   "description": "Commodore's Kickstart 3.1 (40.68) for the A1200, 512 KB (256 KB for 1.3), for the A1200OG, A1200. Amiga Forever names it amiga-os-310-a1200.rom; it is also found as kick40068.A1200. It is Commodore's and you have to supply it.",
   "size": 524288,
   "sha1": "E21545723FE8374E91342617604F1B3D703094F1",
   "name": "amiga-os-310-a1200.rom",
