  {
   "id": "amiga-os-310-a4000.rom",
   "display": "Kickstart 3.1 (40.68) for the A4000",
   "description": "Commodore's Kickstart 3.1 (40.68) for the A4000, 512 KB (256 KB for 1.3), for the A4030, A4040. Amiga Forever names it amiga-os-310-a4000.rom; it is also found as kick40068.A4000. It is Commodore's and you have to supply it.",
   "size": 524288,
   "sha1": "5FE04842D04A489720F0F4BB0E46948199406F49",
   "name": "amiga-os-310-a4000.rom",
